    "image_path": "images/slide_04.png",
    "page_text_ocr_zh": "他们把时间花在\n做飞机模型、\n打扫卫生、\n吃草莓香草冰激凌。\n有一天，邮递员送来一个奇怪的包裹。\n他们一起拆开了包裹，",
    "page_text_en": "They spent their time\nbuilding model airplanes,\nkeeping the house clean,\neating strawberry-vanilla ice cream.\nOne day, the postman delivered a strange package.\nThey opened the package together,",
    "summary_zh": "本页通过四幅插图和文字，展示了乔治和贝拉的日常生活，包括做飞机模型、打扫卫生、吃冰激凌，以及收到并拆开一个奇怪的包裹。"
  },
  {
    "title_zh": "小怪兽(1.5-3 岁)",
    "title_en": "Little Monster (1.5-3 years)",
    "target_age": "5-3",
    "source_type": "ppt",
    "source_file": "小怪兽(1.5-3 岁) .ppt",
    "page_index_in_story": 5,
    "source_page": 5,
    "image_path": "images/slide_05.png",
    "page_text_ocr_zh": "看见一个粉嫩嫩的婴儿，非常漂亮！\n他的脖子上挂着一个标签：\n“他叫小怪兽。”\n\n小怪兽太可爱了！\n乔治和贝拉把他抛过来、抛过去，\n快乐地过了一天。",
    "page_text_en": "They saw a pink, tiny baby, very cute!\nA tag hung around his neck:\n\"His name is Little Monster.\"\n\nLittle Monster was so adorable!\nGeorge and Bella threw him back and forth,\nand happily spent a day together.",
    "summary_zh": "乔治和贝拉打开包裹后发现一个粉嫩的婴儿，脖子上挂着写有“小怪兽”的标签，他们非常喜爱这个婴儿，开心地把他抛来抛去，度过了快乐的一天。"
  },
  {
    "title_zh": "小怪兽(1.5-3 岁)",
    "title_en": "Little Monster (1.5-3 years)",
    "target_age": "5-3",
    "source_type": "ppt",
    "source_file": "小怪兽(1.5-3 岁) .ppt",
    "page_index_in_story": 6,
    "source_page": 6,
    "image_path": "images/slide_06.png",
    "page_text_ocr_zh": "虽然，小怪兽不是最完美的婴儿，\n\n但是，看到他可爱\n又迷人的笑容，\n乔治和贝拉\n还是非常满意。\n\n他们开心地把他抛过来、抛过去，\n而且越来越高。\n他们的生活真是幸福又美好。\n\n直到有一天……",
    "page_text_en": "Although, the little monster was not the most perfect baby,\n\nbut seeing his cute\nand charming smile,\nGeorge and Bella\nwere still very satisfied.\n\nThey happily tossed him back and forth,\nand higher and higher.\nTheir life was truly happy and wonderful.\n\nUntil one day……",
    "summary_zh": "本页描绘了乔治和贝拉与小怪兽相处的温馨日常，尽管小怪兽不完美，但他们因他的笑容而非常满意，开心地玩耍，生活幸福美好，直到有一天发生转折。"
  },
  {
    "title_zh": "小怪兽(1.5-3 岁)",
    "title_en": "Little Monster (1.5-3 years)",
    "target_age": "5-3",
    "source_type": "ppt",
    "source_file": "小怪兽(1.5-3 岁) .ppt",
    "page_index_in_story": 7,
    "source_page": 7,
    "image_path": "images/slide_07.png",
    "page_text_ocr_zh": "乔治和贝拉早上起床后，\n发现小怪兽变成一只好大的秃鹰。\n\n他的尖叫声非常可怕。",
    "page_text_en": "George and Bella got up in the morning,\nand found the little monster had turned into a huge vulture.\n\nHis scream was very terrifying.",
    "summary_zh": "乔治和贝拉早上起床后，发现小怪兽变成了一只巨大的秃鹰，它的尖叫声非常可怕，让他们感到惊吓。"
  },
  {
    "title_zh": "小怪兽(1.5-3 岁)",
    "title_en": "Little Monster (1.5-3 years)",
    "target_age": "5-3",
    "source_type": "ppt",
    "source_file": "小怪兽(1.5-3 岁) .ppt",
    "page_index_in_story": 8,
    "source_page": 8,
    "image_path": "images/slide_08.png",
    "page_text_ocr_zh": "到了晚上，叫声更加恐怖。\n\n“我们该怎么办？”乔治说，\n“我们怎么受得了？”\n\n接下来……",
    "page_text_en": "At night, the screams became even more terrifying.\n\n\"What should we do?\" George said,\n\"How can we stand it?\"\n\nNext……",
    "summary_zh": "小怪兽在晚上发出更加恐怖的叫声，乔治和贝拉感到惊恐，不知如何是好，故事进入新的发展阶段。"
  },
  {
    "title_zh": "小怪兽(1.5-3 岁)",
    "title_en": "Little Monster (1.5-3 years)",
    "target_age": "5-3",
    "source_type": "ppt",
    "source_file": "小怪兽(1.5-3 岁) .ppt",
    "page_index_in_story": 9,
    "source_page": 9,
    "image_path": "images/slide_09.png",
    "page_text_ocr_zh": "他们一早起床后，发现小怪兽变成了一头小象。\n\n他把家具都撞翻了！\n\n还把桌巾拉下来！\n\n任何能用鼻子卷起来的东西，\n他都把它们吃进肚子里。\n\n“真可怕！”贝拉说，\n“我们该怎么处理他呢？”\n\n接下来……",
    "page_text_en": "They woke up one morning to find the little monster had turned into a baby elephant.\n\nHe knocked over all the furniture!\n\nHe even pulled the tablecloth down!\n\nAnything he could pick up with his trunk,\nhe stuffed into his stomach.\n\n\"How terrible!\" Bella said,\n\"What should we do with him?\"\n\nNext……",
    "summary_zh": "小怪兽早上醒来变成了一头小象，用鼻子撞翻家具、拉下桌布并吃掉所有能卷起的东西，乔治和贝拉感到害怕，不知如何是好。"
  },
